Description: Server-side infrastructure for the 'metasurvey' ecosystem: a
    'plumber' REST API (backed by MongoDB) for recipe and workflow storage, and
    a compute worker that bakes recipes and runs workflows over private
    microdata. These are deployable services (Docker, Railway, Cloud Run), not a
    user-facing R package; the R client lives in 'metasurvey.explorer.backend'.
